    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Good",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "toad"
      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Liberated Toads cohort sheet — Granite.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-liberated-toads-actors.py</code> from the Pond Patrol docket (<code>data/liberatedToadsSystem.json</code>, snapshot Highsun 24, 1040 BF): level 4 on the docket → CR 1 as militia (toads with basic combat training, forming the backbone of defense); leather armour and a patrol shield (AC 14), hit points 4d8 + 8. A GM-ready reading of the docket, not a filed stat line; the docket stays the authority.</p><p><strong>Pond Patrol</strong> — Security, enforcement of Speaker L's decrees, protection of the Cohort. Leader: Captain Fernback. The elite enforcement arm of the Liberated Toads. Still loyal to Speaker L, but operating under Captain Fernback while the Speaker is absent. The Reclamation of the Vigilance restored a headquarters and created too many doors to guard at once.</p><p><strong>On the docket:</strong> Corridor watch, level 4.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Equipment</strong> — Standard arms, Patrol gear, Restraint equipment (the weapon items)</li><li><strong>Specialisations</strong> — Containment, Apprehension, Protection (the cohort feat)</li><li><strong>Militia</strong> — classDefinitions.militia: Basic Training (L1); Shield Wall (L2); Stand Your Ground (L3)</li><li><strong>Status</strong> — overextended: Split between reclaimed Vigilance security, Raventree perimeter watch, prisoner handling, and Speaker L search protocols</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
